        {
          "name": "Out Error Messages",
          "type": "TArray<FString>&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Handlers to be implemented by each custom attribute, for each type that custom attributes can be applied to.  Returns false if\nwe were unable to process for the specified name, and implies the linker task will retry again until it succeeds."
